103
00:06:13,625 --> 00:06:16,041
Follow me.
I'll give you the tour.

104
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:33,500
<i>♪ The TV's on,
the woman's blonde ♪</i>

105
00:06:33,583 --> 00:06:36,291
<i>♪ She talks and talks
of how the rich are wrong ♪</i>

106
00:06:36,375 --> 00:06:39,041
<i>♪ They cheat on wives,
never pay the price ♪</i>

107
00:06:39,125 --> 00:06:42,583
<i>♪ I'm a low-class guy,
that sounds pretty nice ♪</i>

108
00:06:42,666 --> 00:06:47,208
<i>♪ I want to be with
the bourgeoisieses ♪</i>

109
00:06:48,625 --> 00:06:52,458
<i>♪ I want to be see how
the bourgeoisieses ♪</i>

110
00:06:52,541 --> 00:06:54,041
<i>♪ Party all night ♪</i>

111
00:06:54,125 --> 00:06:58,541
<i>♪ I want to be with
the bourgeoisieses ♪</i>

112
00:07:00,208 --> 00:07:03,958
<i>♪ I want to be see how
the bourgeoisieses ♪</i>

113
