175
00:11:22,375 --> 00:11:24,833
Come on.

176
00:11:24,916 --> 00:11:26,000
Oops.

177
00:11:28,041 --> 00:11:29,041
I'm not gonna rise to it

178
00:11:29,125 --> 00:11:31,000
and give you the satisfaction
