but we haven't heard it enough.

191
00:13:18,666 --> 00:13:20,625
Now is the time for action.

192
00:13:27,666 --> 00:13:28,916
Thank you.

193
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,958
<i>You looked like you needed this.</i>

194
00:13:31,041 --> 00:13:33,125
These men and women
